# Layout engineering

Reconstruct layout logic using normal flow, Flexbox, CSS Grid, gap, padding, min-width:0, minmax(), clamp(), intrinsic sizing, max-width and auto margins.

Do not use arbitrary absolute positioning, top/left coordinates, translateX/Y or magic margins for ordinary layout.

Absolute/fixed/sticky only when semantics justify it: overlays, popovers, tooltips, badges, sticky header/composer, mobile bottom nav, decorative layers.

A screenshot match achieved through brittle X/Y placement is a failed implementation.
